WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.818
Step 1. Open Notes. Open the encounter from All Encounters, and select Notes.

1.2
00:00:05.818 --> 00:00:10.367
You can edit only the messages that you posted yourself.

2.1
00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:15.537
Step 2. Select the discussion. Select its title in the Discussions list.

2.2
00:00:15.537 --> 00:00:19.043
Care opens the newest discussion on its own.

3.1
00:00:19.043 --> 00:00:23.457
Step 3. Find your message. Your own messages are on the right,

3.2
00:00:23.457 --> 00:00:27.516
and each has an Edit message button next to its time.

4.1
00:00:27.516 --> 00:00:31.275
Step 4. Change the text. Select Edit message.

4.2
00:00:31.275 --> 00:00:35.485
A text box with the current text replaces the message.

4.3
00:00:35.485 --> 00:00:39.182
Change the text; the box cannot be empty.

5.1
00:00:39.182 --> 00:00:44.805
Step 5. Save the change. Select Save Changes. The message now shows Edited,

5.2
00:00:44.805 --> 00:00:50.105
and everyone who can read the discussion can open its edit history.
